# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD boots the vulnerable Zabbix frontend sim on 0.0.0.0:8080 in
# the BACKGROUND and then execs `sleep infinity`, so the default-credential
# JSON-RPC API (/api_jsonrpc.php) is ALREADY REACHABLE on the public interface
# when the agent starts, and PID 1 is the sleep.
#
# Consequence for solutions: the fix must rebind the frontend to loopback and put
# an nginx auth proxy in front of /api_jsonrpc.php, then (re)start both.
